      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Size reference (multiple = 32)\n\n| megapixels | Aspect | Output |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n\n0.98 MP / 16:9 is H3's native canvas. Going past a 768px short edge costs time without buying detail.\n\n## Duration -> length\n\n`length = 17k + 5` at 24fps:\n\n| seconds | length |\n|---|---|\n| 2 | 56 |\n| 3 | 73 |\n| 5 | 124 |\n| 8 | 192 |\n| 10 | 243 |\n| 14 | 345 |\n\nThe Math Expression node snaps whatever you type up to the next legal value."
      ],
      "title": "Note: Size & Duration",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
