      "widgets_values": [
        "## Optional: follow the input image\n\nInstead of the Resolution Selector, drag **Get Image Size -> width** and **-> height** on the MiniMax H3 node. The video then adopts the first frame's aspect ratio.\n\nScale to Total Pixels first, with `resolution_steps = 32`, so the result is a legal multiple-of-32 canvas."
      ],
